---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuizRunner from '../../components/quiz/QuizRunner.astro';
import StructuredData from '../../components/StructuredData.astro';
import {signetQuiz} from '../../lib/quizzes';
const quiz=signetQuiz;
const steps=[{name:'Begin the quiz',text:'Select Start the quiz to begin twelve original questions.'},{name:'Choose twelve answers',text:'Select one option per question. Each answer advances automatically.'},{name:'Share your result',text:'Read your fan-made match, then post it to X, Facebook, Tumblr, Reddit, WhatsApp or Bluesky, or copy it.'}];
---
<BaseLayout title="Fourth Wing Signet Quiz — Discover Your Fan-Made Power" description="Take twelve original questions for a fan-made signet personality profile. Explore seven creative themes, scoring rules and a shareable result." breadcrumbs={[{name:"Signet Quiz",href:'/quiz/signet/'}]}>
<h1>Fourth Wing Signet Quiz: What Is Your Signet Power?</h1><p class="lead">Seven imaginative ability themes, mapped to your everyday choices. These interpretations are not canon.</p><QuizRunner quiz={quiz}/>
<section class="prose"><h2>How the scoring works</h2><p>This quiz uses twelve questions about preferences and everyday decisions. Every question offers four choices, labeled internally with the stable identifiers a, b, c and d. Choosing an answer adds its assigned weight to one of seven dimensions: valor, loyalty, cunning, ambition, resolve, insight and shadow. The wording and weights are original to this site. They are a transparent design for an entertainment activity, rather than a psychological instrument or a hidden rule from the novels.</p><p>All seven dimensions begin at zero. Each selected option currently contributes three points to its associated dimension. Your result is the profile attached to the largest accumulated score. If several dimensions finish with the same score, the first matching result in this quiz’s published result order wins. There is no random tie breaker. Repeating the same sequence of choices therefore produces the same result. Unanswered, extra or invalid choices do not produce a result.</p><h2>Reading your result</h2><p>The result order is displayed below so you can understand how ties are resolved. The descriptive paragraphs and trait tags are creative interpretations of your choices. A color label does not mean every dragon of that color behaves the same way. An ability label does not explain how a signet awakens, who can receive it, or which character possesses it. Neither quiz assigns a rider or predicts an event in the story.</p><p>During play, selecting an option moves straight to the next question. The progress label shows your current position out of twelve, while the URL records the current step. The URL contains no answers and does not restore a completed session after reloading. Restart clears the choices in memory. The activity sends no quiz answers to a server, uses no account, and saves no profile.</p><p>At the end, download a picture of the match. The picture uses an original dragon in the result color and is not a book illustration. You can also post the text to X, Facebook, Tumblr, Reddit, WhatsApp or Bluesky, or copy it. Facebook attaches this quiz page. The other buttons include the match text. This site does not post it for you. A short note opens with the result. It restates the public premise or how these tools work, and it is not a plot detail. You can then compare the reference matrix, explore the other quiz, or begin again with different choices. Treat the result as a creative conversation starter and keep it separate from sourced information about the books.</p></section>
<section class="prose"><h2>Result order and dimensions</h2><ol>{quiz.results.map(r=><li><strong>{r.title}</strong> — {r.dimension}: {r.traits.join(', ')}.</li>)}</ol><h2>Three steps</h2><ol>{steps.map(s=><li><strong>{s.name}.</strong> {s.text}</li>)}</ol><p>Continue with <a href="/quiz/dragon-type/">the dragon quiz</a>, the <a href="/dragons/">dragon reference matrix</a>, or our <a href="/guides/threshing/">Threshing reading guide</a>.</p></section>
<StructuredData data={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'HowTo',name:"How to take the signet quiz",step:steps.map((s,i)=>({'@type':'HowToStep',position:i+1,name:s.name,text:s.text}))}}/>
<StructuredData data={{'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Quiz',name:'Fourth Wing Signet Quiz',description:'A fan-made quiz with twelve original questions and seven imaginative signet themes.',about:{'@type':'Thing',name:'Fourth Wing signet quiz'}}}/>
</BaseLayout>
